WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Pacific North Systems introduces Never Miss.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:13.000
In the world of contracting, you are always on the move, and you cannot always stop working to answer every phone call.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
But every missed call could be your next big job.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.000
That is why we created Never Miss.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Never Miss works with your existing business number. There is no new number to advertise.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:38.000
When you are busy on site and cannot answer, your caller receives a friendly, professional text message.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Every missed number and incoming message is organized into a clean, dedicated workflow for you.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:54.000
A valuable opportunity never disappears inside a cluttered call history.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:01.000
You keep answering calls normally when you can. There is no complicated system to learn.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Keep working. Keep building. Never Miss protects your next conversation.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Start your pilot today at PacificNorthSystems.com.
